<http://data.silknow.org/object/a9f0baaa-788d-340e-bc4d-d50ce3f2b3b1/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Complete sari, red cotton warps, black cotton wefts with yellow silk wefts in horizontal bands at both ends. Squared field with brocaded motifs in metal-wrapped thread. Away from the pallu end the squares become larger and the brocaded motifs become smaller and sparser. The pallu end has a row of nine stylized floral motifs (butis) and a band of red cotton wefts and metal-wrapped thread. Narrow side borders with a diaper pattern in white cotton."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/a9f0baaa-788d-340e-bc4d-d50ce3f2b3b1> .

